# P1 swept through all three zones under repeated notes (nylon -> steel -> stiff -> metal), then P2 from palm mute
# to the bow zone, with a pitch bend on a ringing stiff string (the delay ramps; tuning follows the filters).
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 1.0
track lead
preset 0 150 0 0 255 40 0 0 128 0 128 190 0 0 0 0 0 0
sweep p1 0 255 0 16
note 0 A3 2 110
note 2 A3 2 110
note 4 A3 2 110
note 6 A3 2 110
note 8 A3 2 110
note 10 A3 2 110
note 12 A3 2 110
note 14 A3 2 110
param p1 128 16
sweep p2 0 255 16 28
note 16 D4 4 120
bend 18 200
bend 20 -200
bend 22 0
note 20 G3 4 100
note 24 C4 4 127
note 28 C4 2 127
expect sound 0 30
expect idle 40
expect peak_below -6
